<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaManufacturingExecution/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/abstract> "This module contains terms and relations necessary for representing the actual occurrences of manufacturing processes with respect to recipes." .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaManufacturingExecution/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Adlane Rebai, Millipore Sigma" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaManufacturingExecution/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Ana Nikolov, OAGi" .
