<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaManufacturingExecution/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Cameron Gibbs, CrownPoint Technologies, LLC" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaManufacturingExecution/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Gabriela Henning, NIST" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaManufacturingExecution/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Jan Kemper, AstraZeneca" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaManufacturingExecution/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Marie-Aude Coutouly, Millipore Sigma" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaManufacturingExecution/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Melissa Weller, CrownPoint Technologies, LLC" .
