<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaManufacturingExecution/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Stephen J. Granite, CrownPoint Technologies, LLC" .
<https://spec.industrialontologies.org/ontology/biopharma/BiopharmaManufacturingExecution/> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/contributor> "Stephen Kahmann, CrownPoint Technologies, LLC" .
